# deps & build artifacts (installed/produced inside the image)
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.astro
**/storybook-static

# secrets & local env (runtime env comes from the container platform)
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example

# vcs, tooling, editor, tests
.git
.githooks
.vscode
test-results
playwright-report

# storybook stories are dev-only
**/*.stories.*

**/.DS_Store
